at="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>ODAJIMA, WATARU</last-name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><last-name>TAWA, FUMIHIRO</last-name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A magneto-optic recording head capable of high-density recording by using an extremely small beam of light to irradiate a recording medium. A beam of light larger in size than the magnetic head is concentrated through a light-guide layer, further concentrated by a pointed tip, and emitted to the record medium through an opening, smaller than the wavelength of light, in the point of the tip.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une tête d'enregistrement magnéto-optique pouvant enregistrer à haute densité au moyen d'un faisceau lumineux extrêmement fin pour irradier un support d'enregistrement. Un faisceau lumineux dont la taille est plus grande que celle de la tête magnétique est concentré à travers une couche optique, puis concentré par une pointe ogivale et dirigé vers le support d'enregistrement à travers une ouverture plus petite que la longueur d'onde de la lumière dans l'extrémité de la pointe.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>